>
  <h2>1. Controller</h2>
  <p>
    The controller within the meaning of the EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) for this website and the
    dejavue platform is:
  </p>
  <div class="legal-card">
    <div><span class="k">Name</span><span class="v">Lars Benedikt Kaesberg</span></div>
    <div><span class="k">Address</span><span class="v">Hannoversche Straße 8, 37075 Göttingen, Germany</span></div>
